title: Economic Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/portraits/TVSoong.jpg
go-to: econ_menu
#subtitle: Issues of investment, centralization and others relating to the economy.

= Economic Policy

Economic Policy concerns our usage of money to improve the economy. 

@econ_menu

- @centralize: We will attempt to centralize the economy.
- @infrastructure: We will build up infrastructure in the state.
- @business: We will encourage Chinese businesses.
- @illegalize: Illegalize Gambling.
- @relegalize: Relegalize Gambling.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@centralize
subtitle: -2 budget - Centralize the tax system and fiscal policy.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 budget
choose-if: budget >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; economic_growth += 0.6; centralize += 1;

Centralizing the tax system will make the economy more efficient and stable.

@infrastructure
subtitle: -2 budget - Build more roads, railways and improve our ports.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 budget
choose-if: budget >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; economic_growth += 1; inflation -= 1;

Building more infrastructure does well for our income.

@business
subtitle: -1 budget - Encourage small Chinese businesses and let new ones grow.
unavailable-subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; economic_growth += 0.5; old_middle_kmt += 5; new_middle_kmt += 5;

The middle class likes this, and our economy grows higher.

@illegalize
subtitle: Gambling was recently relegalized to raise more funds. Should we illegalize it once more?
view-if: gambling = 1
choose-if: gambling = 1
on-arrival: gambling = 0; economic_growth -= 0.5; old_middle_kmt += 4; new_middle_kmt += 4; workers_kmt += 4;

Gambling is illegal once again, giving us some support with the people.

@relegalize
subtitle: +1 budget - Gambling was recently illegalized. Should we relegalize it once more?
view-if: gambling = 0
choose-if: gambling = 0
on-arrival: gambling = 1; budget += 1; economic_growth += 0.5; old_middle_kmt -= 4; new_middle_kmt -= 4; workers_kmt -= 4;

Gambling is legal once again, giving us more funds but decreasing our support.
